---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: QLEAN - Context Diagram
  accDescr: QLEAN as a single system with a creator and a link visitor as external actors.
  Creator["Creator<br/>Guest / Member"]
  System(("0<br/>QLEAN<br/>Short URL and<br/>QR System"))
  Visitor["Link Visitor"]

  Creator -->|Credentials / session data;<br/>URL / QR content, alias and design;<br/>optional code and organization;<br/>owned link / date range requests| System
  System -->|Account / operation status;<br/>short URLs and QR images;<br/>member library and owner details;<br/>statistics and CSV / PDF reports| Creator
  Visitor -->|Short code;<br/>six-digit access code| System
  System -->|Redirect URL / QR text;<br/>access prompt / denial| Visitor

  classDef actor fill:#eef5fc,stroke:#363636,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef process fill:#eff8f3,stroke:#363636,stroke-width:1.5px;
  class Creator,Visitor actor;
  class System process;
